{"INVENTORY_FULL","",{"Can't carry another thing, my pack's full","I'm overloaded, I'm already overloaded","No room, no room at all, something has to go","I'm packed tight, bursting at the seams","Too heavy, I can't lift one more ounce","My arms are about to fall off, honest","There's no space for that, leave it","Full up, you take it","My bag's at the limit, somebody help me carry","Gotta drop something to take that, and I won't","Not another can, I can't, I can't carry it","Spine's gonna snap if I add one more thing"}},
