{"KILL_CONFIRMED","reg=law",{"He's down - watch his hands anyway","Suspect's down - stay back from him","Got him - God help me, I got him","He's not getting up, kick that gun away","Somebody check him - careful","Shooter's down"}},
{"KILL_CONFIRMED","reg=swat",{"Suspect down!","He's down - cover him","Down, secure that weapon","One down - stay on it","Got him","He's done - next"}},
