{"KILL_CONFIRMED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Oh God, I think I killed him","He's down - he's down, right?","I got him, I didn't-- I got him","Is he dead? Don't go near him","I shot him, I actually shot him","He stopped moving - oh Lord"}},
{"KILL_CONFIRMED","reg=raider,outlaw,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Ha! Lights out!","Down he goes - check his pockets","That one's done crying","Next!","Bye bye - who's next?","Should've stayed home, buddy"}},
