{"LOCATION_COMMENT","",{"Where the hell are we?","Doesn't look like anything I know","Nice neighborhood, once","Wonder who lived here","Somebody cared about this place, look at the garden","Seems like every town looks the same now","Never been this way before","You think anybody's still around here?","Funny, you drive past a place a hundred times and never really see it","Hard to believe people ate dinner here last month","Whole row of houses, and not one light on","Where is everybody? Where did everybody go?","It's not the same, is it, not at all"}},
{"LOCATION_COMMENT","world=road",{"This used to be a nice street"}},
{"LOCATION_COMMENT","world=window",{"Quiet, too many windows, too many places to hide"}},
{"LOCATION_COMMENT","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=sad",{"I used to come through here with my parents on Sundays","It's like a ghost town, a ghost town, just like in the movies","I wonder what this place was like before","That's the ice cream place, remember? We used to get cones"}},
