{"LONG_WALK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"How much farther? Honest answer","My feet are blistered all over","My feet are begging me to stop, and I'm pretending not to hear","If I fall, just roll me, I'll catch up","Are we there yet? Don't answer, I know","My feet hurt, my back hurts, my soul hurts, can we stop soon?","How much farther? Don't tell me, I don't want to know","Walking, walking, walking, I'm so sick of walking","Does anyone else feel like we're walking in circles?"}},
